      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/installing/installing_aws/ipi/installing-aws-customizations#manually-create-iam_installing-aws-customizations">Manually creating long-term credentials</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_credentials_access-keys.html">Managing access keys for IAM Users (AWS documentation)</a></li>
